              "lineEnd": 16562,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "737d5252aee5f749b98ae93f8e86277f967cf786ffa6162ef2990d1ff2f3d32c"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "hls-saturation-axis",
        "moduleId": "hls-parameters",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "色饱和度 S",
        "markdown": "色饱和度 S 描述颜色的相对纯度，取值范围是 0 到 1。对纯色彩来说 S = 1 且 L = 0.5。S 减小时，白色成分增加，颜色的纯度随之下降；当 S = 0 时，颜色只剩灰度，不再有色彩倾向。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-abebc170f9271e4546887278",
